cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "local-llm-gateway: a local-first, fail-closed OpenAI-compatible LLM gateway"
abstract: >-
  A zero-dependency, fail-closed client for any OpenAI-compatible LLM
  endpoint (Ollama, vLLM, llama.cpp server, LM Studio or a cloud provider).
  It is intended as the perception layer of deterministic finance
  architectures: the model may only read (extract JSON), never compute. Bad
  model output fails loudly instead of being silently repaired. An optional
  JSONL evidence log records prompt/response SHA-256 hashes, latency and
  retry counts without storing client text.
type: software
